CrickEra is a new cricket app with the cricket world's most up-to-date information, match coverage, live results, commentary, news.

Key feature:
* Instant results and match commentary;
* Detailed match commentary;
* Notifications of top matches, news and insights;
* exclusive reviews and articles;
* Schedule of upcoming matches and results of past matches;
* Team information;
* Statistics, tournament positions by leagues;
* Similar match information:
  - team line-ups, injured players, substitutions;
  - chronology of key events;
  - venue information and interesting facts;
  - online commentary during the matches.

Follow the whole cricketing world events from any part of the globe with CricketEra.
